          "message": "feat(keepalive): expose tcp keep-alive options (#1583)\n\n* expose tcp keep-alive options\n\n* expose tcp keep-alive options\n\n* add to client\n\n* add to server\n\n* cleanup\n\n* serve only if http2 is available\n\n* http2 is always available from crates feature flags\n\n* remove http2 feature flag\n\n* typo fix\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: James Wilson <james@jsdw.me>",
